      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَذِّنٌ</span></b>  <i>One who notifies, makes known,</i> or <i>proclaims,</i> [by a chant,] <i>the time of prayer;</i> (M, *
Msb, K; *) [i. e., <i>who chants the call to prayer;</i>]
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذِينٌ</span></b> . (M, K.)

